╭─ DeviceChain · Installing · kind-devicechain ────────────────────────────────╮
│ Help · Install progress                                                      │
│ A question is waiting: close help to answer it.                              │
│                                                                              │
│ y/n         answer                                                           │
│ l           logs                                                             │
│ Ctrl+C      stop                                                             │
│ ?/F1        help                                                             │
│                                                                              │
│ The run goes on while help is open: help never pauses or stops it. Ctrl+C    │
│ stops the run safely and waits for it to settle; a second Ctrl+C exits at    │
│ once. Esc never stops it. Nothing is rolled back. The overall bar counts     │
│ finished stages, never a percentage, and a stage's bar is full only once the │
│ stage has finished. Work with no known total shows that it is working, never │
│ a number. l opens the log pane; while it is open PgUp and PgDn scroll it,    │
│ and f follows it again.                                                      │
